			<TRAN name="obwat_csad_023r" title="랩상품 목록 조회 (채널)" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="125" _ulen="93" >

WA_PRNM^랩어카운트상품명^100^0^0^0^0^0^0
NRML_YN^정상여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
