				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="463" _ulen="341" >

WA_PRCD^랩어카운트상품코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
WA_PRNM^랩어카운트상품명^100^0^0^0^0^0^0
MGRI_MNBD_CLS_CODE^운용주체구분코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
PROD_RISK_CLCD^상품위험구분코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
HGDT_PROD_YN^고난도상품여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
MIN_JOIN_AMT^최소가입금액^19^0^7^0^0^0^0
INVT_TRGT_TYPE_NAME^투자대상유형명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0
UI_FEE_NAME^UI수수료명^100^0^0^0^0^0^0
ADCP_NAME^자문사명^1024^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="NextBlock1" inout="next" _len="58" _ulen="40" >

WA_PRCD^랩어카운트상품코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
