				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="94" _ulen="72" >

WA_PRCD^랩어카운트상품코드^12^0^0^0^0^0^0
PROS_CLS_CODE^구분^1^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
